  "subject": "a cha chaan teng waiter who has written the same order slip for a regular at table seven for three years without a word between them, until she orders in his kitchen shorthand and adds one more item",
  "caption": "1980s Cantopop synth power ballad, gated-drum Hong Kong TV-theme style. DX7 electric piano playing slow arpeggiated chords, analog string-synth pad swelling under the chorus, fretless bass gliding on long notes, gated-reverb snare on beats two and four, clean chorused guitar answering the vocal. Warm polished 1985 studio sheen with wide chorus on the synths. Male tenor, mid-high register, sustained long notes, sincere and restrained delivery. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 72 BPM, E-flat major. Tender, bashful, slow-burning love. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM drops, no modern pop drums, no rap, no distorted guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n三點鐘，七號枱，你都準時坐低\n未等你開口，我已經寫好單\n熱奶茶，走甜，一路落到廚房\n呢個暗號，我背咗成三年\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我對門口大聲叫「歡迎」\n心入面細細聲，叫嘅係你\n[Chorus]\n熱奶茶，走甜，我替你寫好\n點解我一句，都講唔出口\n單尾嗰個角落，畫咗粒心\n你畀錢嗰陣，從來都冇睇\n[Verse]\n今日你遲咗，成十分鐘未到\n七號枱空咗，我擦咗又擦\n老闆話：「喂，個枱乾淨喇」\n我話：「我知，我睇住時鐘」\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你推開玻璃門，頭髮亂咗少少\n我就即刻，跑去煲水\n[Chorus]\n熱奶茶，走甜，我替你寫好\n點解我一句，都講唔出口\n單尾嗰個角落，畫咗粒心\n你今日，坐低就望住我\n[Verse]\n我行過去，手震到杯都響\n你抬頭望我，冇問要乜\n你輕輕聲話：「我學咗成三年」\n[Bridge]\n「熱奶茶，走甜。」你用我哋嘅暗號\n「再加一個，」你講，「一個你。」\n[Chorus]\n熱奶茶，走甜，我替你寫好\n原來你一早，睇見嗰粒心\n單尾嗰個角落，有你回應\n我今日，終於講得出口\n[Outro]\n熱奶茶，走甜\n加一個我",
